  description: The Blastflame Battery was developed during the Frontier Purge, when
    conventional weapons failed to contain rapidly mutating biomass. Scientists repurposed
    industrial plasma furnaces into compact, automated defense units. Early prototypes
    were unstable, often consuming their own power cores in spectacular failures.
    Modern versions retain that raw destructive heritage, refined but never fully
    tamed.
  vnDescription: "Blastflame Battery \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE1t tri\u1EC3n trong
    th\u1EDDi k\u1EF3 Thanh tr\u1EEBng Bi\xEAn gi\u1EDBi, khi c\xE1c lo\u1EA1i v\u0169
    kh\xED th\xF4ng th\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 ki\u1EC1m ch\u1EBF \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    sinh kh\u1ED1i bi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED5i nhanh ch\xF3ng. C\xE1c nh\xE0 khoa h\u1ECDc
    \u0111\xE3 c\u1EA3i ti\u1EBFn c\xE1c l\xF2 plasma c\xF4ng nghi\u1EC7p th\xE0nh
    c\xE1c \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7 t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng, nh\u1ECF
    g\u1ECDn. C\xE1c nguy\xEAn m\u1EABu ban \u0111\u1EA7u kh\xF4ng \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh,
    th\u01B0\u1EDDng xuy\xEAn t\u1EF1 ti\xEAu hao l\xF5i n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
    c\u1EE7a ch\xEDnh m\xECnh trong nh\u1EEFng th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i th\u1EA3m h\u1EA1i.
    C\xE1c phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EA1i v\u1EABn gi\u1EEF \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    b\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t h\u1EE7y di\u1EC7t th\xF4 s\u01A1 \u0111\xF3, \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    tinh ch\u1EC9nh nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a bao gi\u1EDD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EBF
    ng\u1EF1 ho\xE0n to\xE0n."
